{"updated_at": {"date": {"d": "26", "m": "11", "Y": "2026"}, "time": {"H": "03", "M": "49", "S": "36"}}, "news": [{"title": "Aroundtown CEO Bar-Hen to step down, two co-CEOs named", "para": "Aroundtown, a significant German real estate company, will witness CEO Barak Bar-Hen stepping down in 2026. Following his departure, Jonas Tintelnot and Kamaldeep Manaktala will assume co-CEO roles. The company reported a notable 62% decline in net profit for the first nine months of the year. Funds from operations decreased as finance expenses increased and one-off gains declined. Additionally, Aroundtown has raised its bottom guidance for future operating performance measurements.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/international/aroundtown-ceo-bar-hen-to-step-down-two-co-ceos-named/136177498?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-76948/136177498.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "international"}, {"title": "Pritam Chakraborty, mother sell Mumbai apartment for \u20b92.30 crore", "para": "Pritam Chakraborty, renowned singer and music producer, alongside his mother, has sold their apartment in Serenity Shree Sai Wing G.H.I. Co-operative Housing Society located in Andheri West, Mumbai. The property, approximately 980.26 square feet in size, fetched \u20b92.30 crore, with registration documents affirming the sale occurred in November 2026. The stamp duty amounted to \u20b911.50 lakh, and registration charges were \u20b930,000.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/residential/pritam-chakraborty-mother-sell-mumbai-apartment-for-2-30-crore/136177188?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-22416/136177188.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "residential"}, {"title": "Strata invests \u20b9250 crore in multi-asset real estate platform Reserve", "para": "Strata plans to invest \u20b9250 crore in Reserve, a real estate platform, in the third quarter of FY27. Reserve aims to develop assets in various sectors, estimating a gross development value of \u20b91,500 crore. The company plans to manage 8-10 projects over the next 12-24 months, primarily focused in Bengaluru. Reserve will also continue to develop its existing residential projects independently.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/allied-industries/strata-invests-250-crore-in-multi-asset-real-estate-platform-reserve/136177072?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-274982/136177072.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "allied-industries"}]}